{"id":"en_my-cold-boss-feels-my-pain","title":"My Cold Boss Feels My Pain","titleEn":"My Cold Boss Feels My Pain","description":"Eliana is an optimistic, hardworking secretary whose life takes an odd turn when she becomes mysteriously connected to Orlando, her arrogant and emotionally distant CEO. Whatever pain or fatigue she endures is passed on to him, so while she keeps pushing through her job without complaint, he quietly bears the consequences. A secret marriage forces them to share a home, and their daily life together swings between comic mishaps and friction. Gradually, affection develops, the once-merciless boss becomes a caring partner, and Eliana learns the truth about her own family. A strange twist of fate thus grows into a tale of love, recovery, and finding where she belongs.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-cold-boss-feels-my-pain/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-cold-boss-feels-my-pain/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Reunion","Fantasy Romance","Secret Marriage","Sweet Romance","Urban Romance","Finding Relatives"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-cold-boss-feels-my-pain_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-cold-boss-feels-my-pain_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-cold-boss-feels-my-pain_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65e/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed"